    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29669" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῠσωρέομαι</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤρα</span>)
